{"availability":"available","full":"NoizAI/YuE2-Turbo","name":"YuE2-Turbo","description":"Fast, concurrent inference for YuE2. Same model and recipe: 1.68× faster per song, 3.31× more songs per GPU.","category":"Other","language":"Python","stars":91,"forks":14,"created":"2026-09-21T11:25:28Z","updated":"2026-09-22T18:48:32Z","license":"Apache-2.0","branch":"main","homepage":"noiz.ai/lp/yue2","topics":["audio-generation","cuda","inference","model-serving","music-generation","pytorch","vllm"],"demo":"https://map-yue2.github.io/","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-13T04:14:38.992Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-13T04:14:38.992Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-13T04:14:38.992Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-09T18:00:40.817Z","stars":85,"forks":13},{"at":"2026-10-13T04:14:38.992Z","stars":91,"forks":14}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Same YuE2 model. 1.68× faster per song. 3.31× more songs per GPU.","🧰 Environment · 🚀 Deploy · ⚙️ Configuration · 🎵 About YuE2 · 🤗 Weights","YuE2-Turbo is an inference acceleration and serving layer for YuE2. It keeps the released YuE2-3B weights and the standard generation recipe (BF16, 32 flow-matching steps) and replaces how they are executed: the autoregressive stages run on vLLM, all weights stay resident on the GPU, acoustic synthesis is batched across requests, and an HTTP job API + browser Studio turn one GPU into a concurrent song-generation service."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/NoizAI/YuE2-Turbo/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"b3a4040d092727bfc05f560c51eb4f7d187751bd18ac73806e5292885e873232","extractedAt":"2026-10-09T18:00:40.932Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-09T18:00:40.932Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Same YuE2 model. 1.68× faster per song. 3.31× more songs per GPU.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/NoizAI/YuE2-Turbo/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"b3a4040d092727bfc05f560c51eb4f7d187